								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Package extension methods on classes that are native in GemStone (e.g. `Dictionary`, `ZnMessage`, the Zinc HTTP classes) are silently left out of GT.gs.  Add a {{gtClass:GtGemStoneExtensionMethods}} descriptor for each one.  Before a load, run `GtGemStoneGtCodeExporter new staticExportAnalysisForPackageNames:` on the changed packages to find them."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
