							},
							"string" : "Wide strings aren't under `String`: `DoubleByteString` and `QuadByteString` are `MultiByteString < CharacterCollection`.  A `String`-only extension misses them, e.g. when JSON parsed from non-Latin-1 text produces `DoubleByteString`s.  Add the descriptor on `CharacterCollection`."
						}
					]
