							"string" : "Methods that use `thisContext`, reference `Smalltalk`, or contain a literal line starting with `%` are listed in {{gtMethod:GtGemStoneGtCodeExporter>>#excludedMethodsList}} and are not exported.  Exclusion overrides `gsCode:`, so when a `gsCode:` variant is added the method must also be removed from that list.  Excluding a method that comes from a trait removes it from every user of the flattened trait."
