							"string" : "`Object>>asString` answers a description such as 'aDictionary', not the print string as in Pharo, and `Collection>>printString` is truncated at 700 characters.  Shared code that turns arbitrary objects into text should use `printOn:` on a stream (`String streamContents: [ :s | anObject printOn: s ]`)."
