							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The GsDevKit `GZipReadStream` fails with `MessageNotUnderstood #squeakReplaceFrom:to:with:startingAt:`.  Don't alias that selector to `replaceFrom:to:with:startingAt:`: inflating relies on a forward, element-by-element copy within one collection, and an overlap-safe copy decodes silently wrong.  Use the native `ByteArray>>_decompress: 1` (1 = gzip header, 0 = raw deflate) in a `gsCode:` variant, as in {{gtMethod:GtLModelExamplesExecutor>>#decodeHistory:}}."
						}
					]
				},
