								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Run examples in the stone with {{gtClass:GtGemStoneExampleRunner}}: add the classes to {{gtMethod:GtGemStoneExampleRunner>>#select}}, run `(GtGemStoneExampleRunner on: GtGemStoneSessionRegistry defaultSession) run`, then inspect `summary` and `notPassed`.  All existing tests and examples must keep passing."
						},
