							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "`gemstoneGetCodeOfMethods` and the other session tools show the GT session's uncommitted compiles, not what a fresh load of GT.gs produces, and uncommitted compiles can be lost.  At milestones, export GT.gs and load it into a clean stone (`loadGsGt.sh`, log in `$GT_CURRENT_DIR/loadGsGt.log`) before trusting a result."
						}
					]
				},
